<description>&lt;p&gt;Violence has intensified in Colombia with a car bomb in Villavicencio that injured more than 20 people and destroyed buildings, and a separate car bomb striking the governor's office in Meta. An ELN drone attack hit a police base, injuring three including an infant, while a separate drone strike hit a Colombian city, showing the spread of unmanned explosives. The ELN also carried out a bombing at a narcoterrorist site in Valle del Cauca, and rebel groups continue to clash with security forces, as reflected by 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/23/world/americas/colombia-farc-peace-deal.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168864&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE42TTdIaV9vTlh1aHYxMEhxZzJBM1FSSHFHdmtQcVRSNlR2Q1FmYnZianR3OEM0dGVvMGhUekVFaW9rN0FqUHEtS2gzdWl5bDkxVDJVUTkxd2pMZmpRQUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxQUzRjb2tDZmlvZm04Q1U2SFBiRUFvYlJiMEs3V0Utb2M4N2pKS0ZPTWVZOV9SLWw4Z1pIQ21YY0RsVUFweHJ3bms4b1pCTlBld0J5Y0o4OFZHdlJJczV0dW43bm1CdVFGaGhmWUc1NnR5WFlaMVRacjVBOUhzcTZ0cXExYVByTEVNbkNWS2xzOURiaHMtTGxV?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economist&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNcDFIWlh3ZS05UXg1NmwyTzI5U1B3LUt3YnlxOVNfSEZKZkdpbVNEZ1ZoaEhrakhpV0FETEQ0UVd